{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"とりゃあ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/asuka.saito/img/files/46/_pre/blog/asuka.saito/img/2013/08/02/2288700/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやたむ。\n携帯いじっててかまってくれない(´・ω・｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あしゅりんたむ寂しい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"近くにいたひなちまに\nかまってかまってアピールしてみる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とりゃあ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/asuka.saito/img/files/46/_pre/blog/asuka.saito/img/2013/08/02/2288700/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"同じく携帯いじってる。\nこっちみてくれない(´・ω・｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"むーーーー\nかまってよーー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かまってかまって⊂二（＾ω＾ ）二二二⊃\nとりゃあ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/asuka.saito/img/files/46/_pre/blog/asuka.saito/img/2013/08/02/2288700/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"がおー(｢･ω･)｢"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いーもん！！別に！知らないもん！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お仕事おわりに、ちーむNで\n遊んじゃうもん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とりゃあ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/asuka.saito/img/files/46/_pre/blog/asuka.saito/img/2013/08/02/2288700/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふあっふあー..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それで川後さんのお家にお泊まりして\nまたお仕事おわりに、ジョイポリス\n行っちゃうもん！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とりゃあ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/asuka.saito/img/files/46/_pre/blog/asuka.saito/img/2013/08/02/2288700/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふあふあちゅいんてーるで\n行っちゃうもんねーだ！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"べーっつに！遊んでばっかじゃないし！\nお仕事がんばったし！帽子買っちゃったし！\n楽しかったしー！！！！！！ずん！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とりゃあ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/asuka.saito/img/files/46/_pre/blog/asuka.saito/img/2013/08/02/2288700/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやたむ ひなちまたむ、遊ぼ？\n(※仲良しです。永遠不滅なりです。)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とりゃあ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/asuka.saito/img/files/46/_pre/blog/asuka.saito/img/2013/08/02/2288700/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずん！！右半分。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お仕事いってきまーす\nんちゃッッ"}],"source":"archive"}